const controlCard=(<div className="settings-card" role="region" aria-label="Browser control"><h2>Laya · browser control</h2>{backend?.laya?.active&&<strong>LAYA ACTIVE</strong>}<p>Type or say "activate laya" for direct isolated Edge navigation this session. "Deactivate laya" or Stop ends it. Notepad, Calculator and Paint open directly while active. No forms, credentials, sending, payment, files or shell.</p><strong>{backend?.laya?.control_busy?'SETTING UP':backend?.laya?.active?'BROWSER SESSION ACTIVE':backend?.browser?.enabled?'REVIEWED BROWSER ON':'OFF'}</strong><p>Page-reasoning model: {backend?.laya?.engine?.ready?'ready':'not loaded; direct open/navigation still available in active mode'}</p><p role="status">{backend?.laya?.active?'Direct browser and fixed-app session enabled':backend?.laya?.control_busy?(backend?.laya?.setup?.busy?backend.laya.setup.status:backend.laya.status):backend?.laya?.status}</p>{backend?.laya?.error&&<p role="alert">{backend.laya.error}</p>}<button disabled={!connected||backend?.laya?.control_busy} onClick={()=>setControlReview(true)}>Enable browser control</button><button disabled={!connected} onClick={()=>{setControlReview(false);void command('browser-stop')}}>Stop browser control</button>{controlReview&&<div role="region" aria-label="Review browser control setup"><h3>Enable browser control?</h3><p>Verify existing files, download missing pinned Laya assets up to1.32GB, then load the CPU model using severalGB RAM. Allow your goals, public hostname and observed link labels to this local model. Stops the current reply and Mic for setup; turn Mic ON yourself afterwards. No browser window, navigation or microphone starts. Exact action Confirm stays required. Isolated Edge, not your ordinary Brave profile. No forms, sending, payments or file actions.</p><button onClick={()=>{setControlReview(false);void command('browser-enable',{consent:true})}}>Confirm browser control setup</button><button onClick={()=>setControlReview(false)}>Cancel browser control setup</button></div>}<p>Type "Jarvis, open the browser" in Agents or Team room, or turn Mic ON and say it. Review appears in the conversation.</p>{view!=='Team'&&<button onClick={()=>navigate('Team')}>Back to Team room</button>}</div>);
